  "slug": "laconic",
  "name": "Laconic",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A brutally brief communication mode that cuts token usage by ~79%. It delivers high-density technical answers using short common words and implicit context, skipping verbose explanations while maintaining clean, professional grammar.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `laconic` (Fewer words, sharper thought).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install laconic@claude-community` from `GabrielBarberini/laconic`.\n\nlaconic is a 300 word skill for AI coding agents inspired by caveman.\n\nA brutally brief communication mode that cuts token usage by ~79%. It delivers high-density technical answers using short common words and implicit context, skipping verbose explanations while maintaining clean, professional grammar.",
